  "id": "BdpvhkWbnq5m4XFD",
  "name": "Support Inbox Triage — classify, prioritise & draft replies",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Support Inbox Triage\nTurns a shared inbox into a prioritised queue.\n\n- Gemini returns **category · urgency · sentiment · summary · reply draft**\n- **Spam** is marked read and skipped\n- **High / critical** or angry customers are escalated to `#support` on Slack\n- Every real ticket gets a **draft reply in the same Gmail thread** — a human reviews and sends\n\nTest it without Gmail: `POST /support-triage` with `{ from, subject, body, demo: true }`.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "bd095792-9f07-5f55-a2cd-c2d76fcd677c",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -40
      ]
    },
